# Bakeoff — classical vs ML, horizon 48 h

- window: **2024-03-01 → 2025-12-31** (era5 truth), horizon **48 h**
- folds: **4 rolling-origin**, seeds: **[42, 7, 1234, 2024, 31337]** (deterministic models run once per fold)
- lower MAE is better; skill is `1 − MAE/MAE_persistence`, higher better
- **NWP lead guard active:** only `_d{N}` columns with `24·N ≥ 48` are used, so every forecast feature was issued at or before the feature time

